WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:01.043
- Well, what is your,

00:00:01.043 --> 00:00:02.230
do you mind showing us your bedroom?

00:00:02.230 --> 00:00:03.280
I like it so far.

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:04.920
Like, can you show us
around just a tiny bit,

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:05.950
it looks so--
- Sure,

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:07.960
here I'm gonna turn around the camera.

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:10.955
- All right.
- There's my dog, Angel Grace.

00:00:10.955 --> 00:00:12.924
See, she's on her bed.

00:00:12.924 --> 00:00:17.040
See I got the ocean
there and the fireplace

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.484
and this is where my TV is

00:00:19.484 --> 00:00:21.307
and I just want to tell you that,

00:00:21.307 --> 00:00:23.287
you know, when I bought this house,

00:00:23.287 --> 00:00:28.190
I was getting a divorce
from my first husband

00:00:28.190 --> 00:00:30.400
and my life, I was,

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:33.740
you know, still on the show, The Nanny

00:00:33.740 --> 00:00:36.296
and my life was very
complicated and intense

00:00:36.296 --> 00:00:41.296
and busy and I needed something
that was extremely calming

00:00:42.418 --> 00:00:47.050
and, you know, very pristine

00:00:47.050 --> 00:00:50.470
and to make me feel very peaceful.

00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:51.680
- You literally just,

00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:53.868
it's like you were in
my last therapy session.

00:00:53.868 --> 00:00:54.701
(laughing)

00:00:54.701 --> 00:00:55.990
I was like, I literally,

00:00:55.990 --> 00:00:58.370
I not only like got a new house,

00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:00.880
it's very white and clean and orange,

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:02.418
it's the same reasoning

00:01:02.418 --> 00:01:04.410
and I also read in my office here,

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:05.820
I looked at Kevin, our art department.

00:01:05.820 --> 00:01:08.253
I was like, please help
me make this make sense.

00:01:08.253 --> 00:01:10.700
I was like, I was like, I need to feel

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:12.400
clean, clean, cleansed

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:13.485
and I just wanted to feel happy

00:01:13.485 --> 00:01:14.318
and it does, that,

00:01:14.318 --> 00:01:15.151
- Well, I have to tell you.
- the colors make me feel

00:01:15.151 --> 00:01:17.140
really good.

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:18.300
- Yeah, me too.
- Yeah.

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:21.790
- And colors do influence how you feel.

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:22.640
- Yeah.

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:24.460
- And I just want to tell you that

00:01:24.460 --> 00:01:26.830
now that you know,

00:01:26.830 --> 00:01:29.890
everything's done and years have passed,

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.870
it's, we're actually
very happily divorced.

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.070
- I know, I know, I love the show.

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:37.660
Y'all did happily divorce, you had,

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:38.650
'cause he's--
- Yes,

00:01:38.650 --> 00:01:40.560
and that inspired the show.

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:43.920
- Yeah, and you're actually
friends with your ex, right?

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:44.810
- Yes, yes.

00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:46.170
We're the best of friends

00:01:46.170 --> 00:01:48.540
and we're still writing partners.

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:51.520
You know, sometimes we,
like we marry people

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:53.430
because we love them

00:01:53.430 --> 00:01:56.630
and I come from a very
provincial upbringing.

00:01:56.630 --> 00:01:59.960
It seemed like that was
the next likely step,

00:01:59.960 --> 00:02:03.430
but it's not always the right choice

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:05.890
and when you figure that out for yourself,

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:08.480
you don't have to and
I got this information

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:10.560
from a very wise old owl

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:13.480
and she said, don't throw the
baby out with the bath water,

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:15.990
just take what's good about it

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:18.700
and nurture the love in a new way

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:20.770
I think is probably the healthiest,

00:02:20.770 --> 00:02:21.723
if you can do it.

